{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VS HERO (Voxblock vs Yoto landing page, "Option B – player vs player")
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Mobile-first hero for /pages/voxblock-vs-yoto (Google Ads campaign Search-Yoto-Conquest-05). Eyebrow, H1, two player
cards side by side (also on phones), a small price note, one primary button and a text link, then a press trust row.
On desktop the copy, button and trust row sit on the left and the cards on the right.

Prices:
* Voxblock player price: read live from the "Voxblock player" product (its cheapest variant, the no-bumper player).
* "from" price on the button: cheapest product on the starter pack collection (available products first; if none is
  in stock, the cheapest of all).
* Yoto prices are plain text in the section settings (they are not on our store). The "£40 less" figure in the H1 is
  worked out from the Yoto Mini setting minus the live Voxblock price. If it cannot be worked out, or Voxblock is not
  cheaper, or the visitor sees a currency other than the shop's, the H1 falls back to the "without a price" wording.

Tracking: a click on the button or the link sends the PostHog event vs_yoto_hero_click { target, page } (posthog-js is
initialised in layout/theme.liquid). No storefront pixel events.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign player = section.settings.player_product
  assign vox_cents = 0
  if player != blank
    assign vox_cents = player.price_min
  endif
  assign vox_price = vox_cents | money

  assign packs = section.settings.collection
  assign from_cents = 0
  assign from_cents_any = 0
  if packs != blank
    for pack in packs.products
      if pack.price_min > 0
        if from_cents_any == 0 or pack.price_min < from_cents_any
          assign from_cents_any = pack.price_min
        endif
        if pack.available
          if from_cents == 0 or pack.price_min < from_cents
            assign from_cents = pack.price_min
          endif
        endif
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  if from_cents == 0
    assign from_cents = from_cents_any
  endif

  assign yoto_mini_cents = section.settings.yoto_mini_price | remove: '£' | remove: ',' | strip | times: 100 | round
  assign saving_cents = yoto_mini_cents | minus: vox_cents
  assign heading = section.settings.heading_fallback
  if vox_cents > 0 and yoto_mini_cents > 0 and saving_cents > 0 and cart.currency.iso_code == shop.currency
    assign saving_text = saving_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
    assign heading = section.settings.heading | replace: '{saving}', saving_text
  endif
-%}

<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero {
    --vs-bg: {{ section.settings.background }};
    --vs-heading: {{ section.settings.heading_color }};
    --vs-text: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    --vs-accent: {{ section.settings.accent_color }};
    --vs-eyebrow: {{ section.settings.eyebrow_color }};
    --vs-button-bg: {{ section.settings.button_background }};
    --vs-button-text: {{ section.settings.button_text_color }};
    background: var(--vs-bg);
    color: var(--vs-text);
    font-family: var(--text-font-family);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    grid-template-areas: "copy" "compare" "actions" "trust";
    row-gap: 12px;
    padding-block: 14px 18px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__copy { grid-area: copy; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__compare { grid-area: compare; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__actions { grid-area: actions; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__trust { grid-area: trust; }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--vs-eyebrow);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero h1.vs-hero__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 25px;
    line-height: 31px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: normal;
    color: var(--vs-heading);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 9px 9px 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border, #d6e6e7);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card--voxblock { border: 2px solid var(--vs-heading); padding: 8px 8px 10px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__top { display: flex; align-items: center; min-height: 22px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__pill {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--vs-heading);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__label { margin: 0; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__media { height: 100px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__media img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__name { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--vs-heading); }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__price { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--vs-accent); }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__line { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 17px; }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__note { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; color: #5a6264; }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__cta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 52px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--vs-button-bg);
    color: var(--vs-button-text);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__cta:hover { filter: brightness(0.95); }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    color: var(--vs-heading);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__cta:focus-visible,
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__link:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--vs-heading); outline-offset: 2px; }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__trust { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__trust img { flex: none; display: block; width: 74px; height: auto; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__trust p { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 17px; }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1000px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 560px);
      grid-template-areas: "copy compare" "actions compare" "trust compare";
      grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;
      align-content: center;
      column-gap: 56px;
      row-gap: 20px;
      padding-block: 36px;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__compare { align-self: center; grid-row: 1 / span 3; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__eyebrow { font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero h1.vs-hero__title { font-size: 38px; line-height: 46px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__cards { gap: 16px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card { gap: 8px; padding: 14px 14px 16px; border-radius: 16px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card--voxblock { padding: 13px 13px 15px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__media { height: 170px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__name { font-size: 16px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__price { font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-card__line { font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__note { font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__actions { max-width: 380px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__link { justify-content: flex-start; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .vs-hero__trust p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; }
  }
</style>

<section class="vs-hero" aria-labelledby="vs-hero-title-{{ section.id }}" {{ section.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="container vs-hero__inner">
    <div class="vs-hero__copy">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="vs-hero__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <h1 class="vs-hero__title" id="vs-hero-title-{{ section.id }}">{{ heading | escape }}</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="vs-hero__compare">
      <div class="vs-hero__cards">
        <div class="vs-card vs-card--voxblock">
          <div class="vs-card__top">
            {%- if section.settings.voxblock_pill != blank -%}<span class="vs-card__pill">{{ section.settings.voxblock_pill | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
          </div>
          {%- if section.settings.voxblock_image != blank -%}
            <div class="vs-card__media">
              {{- section.settings.voxblock_image | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', sizes: '(min-width: 1000px) 250px, 40vw', widths: '160,240,320,400', alt: section.settings.voxblock_name -}}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          <p class="vs-card__name">{{ section.settings.voxblock_name | escape }}</p>
          {%- if vox_cents > 0 -%}<p class="vs-card__price">{{ vox_price }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          <p class="vs-card__line">{{ section.settings.voxblock_line | escape }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-card vs-card--yoto">
          <div class="vs-card__top">
            <p class="vs-card__label">{{ section.settings.yoto_label | escape }}</p>
          </div>
          {%- if section.settings.yoto_image != blank -%}
            <div class="vs-card__media">
              {{- section.settings.yoto_image | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', sizes: '(min-width: 1000px) 250px, 40vw', widths: '160,240,320,400', alt: section.settings.yoto_name -}}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          <p class="vs-card__name">{{ section.settings.yoto_name | escape }}</p>
          <p class="vs-card__price">{{ section.settings.yoto_mini_price | escape }}</p>
          <p class="vs-card__line">{{ section.settings.yoto_line | escape }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="vs-hero__note">{{ section.settings.yoto_player_label | escape }} {{ section.settings.yoto_player_price | escape }}. UK prices, checked {{ section.settings.prices_checked | escape }}.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="vs-hero__actions">
      {%- if packs != blank -%}
        <a class="vs-hero__cta" href="{{ packs.url }}" data-vs-hero-target="starter_packs">
          {{- section.settings.button_text | escape -}}
          {%- if from_cents > 0 %} · from {{ from_cents | money }}{% endif -%}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.link_text != blank -%}
        <a class="vs-hero__link" href="{{ section.settings.link_url | default: '#players' }}" data-vs-hero-target="full_comparison">{{ section.settings.link_text | escape }}</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if section.settings.trust_image != blank or section.settings.trust_text != blank -%}
      <div class="vs-hero__trust">
        {%- if section.settings.trust_image != blank -%}
          {{- section.settings.trust_image | image_url: width: 148 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', width: 74, sizes: '74px', widths: '74,148', alt: section.settings.trust_image_alt -}}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.trust_text != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.trust_text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  (function () {
    if (window.__vsHeroClickBound) return;
    window.__vsHeroClickBound = true;
    document.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
      var link = event.target.closest && event.target.closest('[data-vs-hero-target]');
      if (!link) return;
      try {
        if (window.posthog && typeof window.posthog.capture === 'function') {
          window.posthog.capture('vs_yoto_hero_click', { target: link.getAttribute('data-vs-hero-target'), page: {{ page.url | json }} });
        }
      } catch (e) { /* analytics must never get in the way of the link */ }
    });
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "VS hero",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "shopify-section--vs-hero",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Copy" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Looking at Yoto?" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading (H1)", "default": "No wi-fi, nothing to set up, and {saving} less than a Yoto Mini.", "info": "{saving} is replaced by the live Voxblock player price subtracted from the Yoto Mini price below." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading_fallback", "label": "Heading when the saving cannot be worked out", "default": "No wi-fi, nothing to set up, and ready straight out of the box.", "info": "Used if the saving is zero or negative, a price cannot be read, or the visitor sees a different currency." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Voxblock card" },
    { "type": "product", "id": "player_product", "label": "Player product", "info": "The price shown is this product's cheapest variant, read live." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "voxblock_image", "label": "Image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "voxblock_pill", "label": "Pill", "default": "Best value" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "voxblock_name", "label": "Name (also the image description)", "default": "Voxblock player" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "voxblock_line", "label": "One line", "default": "Story on the book. Plays straight out of the box." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Yoto Mini card (prices typed by hand, not from our store)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "yoto_label", "label": "Small label", "default": "Yoto Mini (4th Gen)" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "yoto_image", "label": "Image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "yoto_name", "label": "Name (also the image description)", "default": "Yoto Mini" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "yoto_mini_price", "label": "Yoto Mini price", "default": "£89.99", "info": "Also used to work out the saving in the heading. Write it like £89.99." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "yoto_line", "label": "One line", "default": "Cards load audio over wi-fi. Set up on a phone first." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Price note under the cards" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "yoto_player_label", "label": "Yoto Player name", "default": "Yoto Player (4th Gen)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "yoto_player_price", "label": "Yoto Player price", "default": "£119.99" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "prices_checked", "label": "Date the Yoto prices were checked", "default": "24 September 2026", "info": "Update this whenever you re-check the Yoto prices." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Buttons" },
    { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Starter pack collection", "info": "The button links here and shows \"from\" the cheapest product in it, read live." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "button_text", "label": "Primary button text", "default": "Shop starter packs", "info": "\" · from £x\" is added automatically." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "link_text", "label": "Text link", "default": "See the full comparison" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "link_url", "label": "Text link target", "default": "#players" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Press trust row" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "trust_image", "label": "Logo" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "trust_image_alt", "label": "Logo description", "default": "As featured in IndyBest, The Independent, 2025" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "trust_text", "label": "Text", "default": "Best budget buy, IndyBest 2025 · Screen-free · British designed" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colours" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background", "label": "Background", "default": "#fff7f0" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "heading_color", "label": "Headings, card border and pill", "default": "#197177" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "text_color", "label": "Text", "default": "#2a555a" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "accent_color", "label": "Prices", "default": "#c2560f" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "eyebrow_color", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "#b8520e", "info": "A touch darker than the price orange: #c2560f is 4.3:1 on the peach background, #b8520e is 4.7:1." },
    { "type": "color", "id": "button_background", "label": "Primary button", "default": "#ff9e57" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "button_text_color", "label": "Primary button text", "default": "#1f2d2f", "info": "Dark text: white on this orange is 2.1:1." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "VS hero" }]
}
{% endschema %}
